# db_gateway's one credentials file. Copy to .env (the loader also creates it
# from this file on first run). .env itself is gitignored.
#
# Leave blank: every Citadel app then shares one token made on first run (INTERNAL_TOKEN_FILE, default ~/.citadel/internal_token). A value here overrides it for this app only.
#
# When set, every route except /health rejects requests without it
# (X-Internal-Token). Leave blank only while every caller stays on this machine.
INTERNAL_API_TOKEN=
#
# Connection secrets (Postgres DSNs, Firestore key paths) also go here.
# Reference them from configs/config_connections.json as "${NAME}".
